usage: python -m tools.cli [-h] [--skip-frontend] [--skip-playwright]
                           [--skip-hooks] [--skip-doctor] [--surface SURFACE]
                           [--no-install-uv]
                           [--profile {docs,minimal,research,runtime}]

Install and verify the local contributor prerequisites for policy-engine.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --skip-frontend       Skip pnpm install for the JavaScript workspace.
  --skip-playwright     Skip Playwright browser installation.
  --skip-hooks          Skip pre-commit installation.
  --skip-doctor         Do not run doctor at the end.
  --surface SURFACE     Optional surface to validate when doctor runs
                        (repeatable).
  --no-install-uv       Fail instead of auto-installing uv when it is missing
                        from PATH.
  --profile {docs,minimal,research,runtime}
                        Dependency tier to sync before optional
                        frontend/bootstrap steps. Default: runtime.
